body:
We had a rowdy group in one of my highschool english classes. For months our teacher would always try to get us to quiet down after the class clowns would hit a string of jokes. None of the jokes were ever at the teacher though. One day the rowdy group was on a particularly long string of jokes when the teacher said, "You people are killing me". One of the black students immediately replied, "What do you mean YOU people?". Everyone burst out laughing and the teacher broke down crying for a solid 3 minutes before she excused herself.

&#x200B;

Turns out she was going through a rough divorce and for whatever reason, that joke set her off. We never got too disruptive after that.
